flowchart TD
    A([Recruiter/Admin opens ResumeIQ]) --> B{Logged in?}
    B -- No --> C[Register or Login]
    C --> D[Flask creates session user_id and username]
    B -- Yes --> E[Dashboard]
    D --> E
    E --> F[Create Job Requirement]
    F --> G[(jobs table)]
    G --> H[Select Job]
    H --> I[Upload multiple PDF/DOCX resumes]
    I --> J[Validate extension: .pdf or .docx]
    J --> K[secure_filename and save to uploads folder]
    K --> L[parse_resume in utils/parser.py]
    L --> M[Extract raw text, email, phone, sections, skills]
    M --> N[preprocess_text with NLTK]
    N --> O[compare_skills with required skills]
    O --> P[SentenceTransformer all-MiniLM-L6-v2 embeddings]
    P --> Q[Cosine similarity for semantic, experience, project scores]
    Q --> R[Weighted ranking formula]
    R --> S[(resumes and candidates tables)]
    S --> T[Dashboard metrics, charts, ranked candidates]
    T --> U{Recruiter decision}
    U --> V[Shortlist]
    U --> W[Reject]
    U --> X[Keep Pending]
    V --> Y[Download shortlisted candidates PDF]
